const Cero: C = ({ t, h }) => <Stage t={t} h={h} mode="ring">{(tt) => <AbsoluteFill><Svg><Defs /><Clamp x={960} y={470} s={1.5} val={tt > 1.5 ? "0.0" : "—"} /><Wire x1={200} x2={1720} y={360} col="#30363c" th={70} /></Svg><Big tt={tt} at={1.6} x={420} y={760} tx="¿0?" size={210} col={RED} /><Lbl tt={tt} at={2.8} x={1420} y={880} tx="TRUCO 30: LO VAS A VER" bg={AMB} /></AbsoluteFill>}</Stage>;
